---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Our Guide Network — Bhutan Echoes"
        description="Bhutan Echoes is building a trusted network of licensed local guides. Tell us about your trip and our team will arrange the right match.">
  <section class="bg-cream-dark border-b border-forest/10">
    <div class="container-x py-14">
      <p class="eyebrow">The right local match</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-serif text-4xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">Our guide network is growing</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-forest/70">
        We’re carefully building a network of licensed Bhutanese guides. For now,
        tell us about your trip and our local team will arrange the right guide personally.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-forest/10 bg-white">
    <div class="container-x grid gap-5 py-6 text-sm sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div><strong class="block text-forest">License checked</strong><span class="text-forest/55">License details are reviewed before approval.</span></div>
      <div><strong class="block text-forest">Experience shown</strong><span class="text-forest/55">Languages, specialties, and guiding years are visible.</span></div>
      <div><strong class="block text-forest">Personal introduction</strong><span class="text-forest/55">Meet your guide before you decide.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-x py-14">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-cream-dark p-6 text-center sm:flex sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:text-left">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold">Not sure which guide fits your trip?</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-forest/60">Tell us your dates and interests and we’ll make a recommendation.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/plan" class="btn-primary mt-5 sm:mt-0">Request a guide match</a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-forest/10 p-6 text-center sm:flex sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:text-left">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold">Are you a licensed Bhutan guide?</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-forest/60">Join the founding network and help shape Bhutan Echoes.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/for-guides" class="btn-outline mt-5 sm:mt-0">Learn about joining</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
